{"title":"The forthcoming Fuchsia Dunlop book","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/949932935/0/marginalrevolution~The-forthcoming-Fuchsia-Dunlop-book.html","date":1773195924000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Five-Tastes-Delicious-Recipes-Chinese/dp/1324050705/ref=sr_1_1?crid=251KMTLENSWB0&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.ge_Z3BLNn-cMNz_0EtGfIg.09GTanpGh6oznJEvzMLMUy44GPasvT8xv_MFetPVqBE&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=fuchsia+dunlop+five+tastes&amp;qid=1773195748&amp;sprefix=fuchsia+dunlop+five+tas%2Caps%2C579&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Five Tastes: Delicious Recipes for Chinese Flavor</a>, due out this fall.  Via Joe Powers in the <strong>MR</strong> comments section.  Hers are the very best Chinese cookbooks and they are also wonderful books more generally.  She has been a CWT guest <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=fuchsia+dunlop+conversations+with+tyler&amp;sca_esv=103eda2c29df25d7&amp;sxsrf=ANbL-n5pVQgZ1Ay82CIcM4z8N39R4NeRAA%3A1773195863380&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=V9KwaeHAFde_hbIPy9bUwA0&amp;iflsig=AFdpzrgAAAAAabDgZ5BCE3e2E3E1dIq5zB-J2OkkKRZJ&amp;oq=fuchsia+dunlop+conversa&amp;gs_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">three times now</a>.  Let us hope a fourth episode is in order…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-forthcoming-fuchsia-dunlop-book.html\">The forthcoming Fuchsia Dunlop book</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/949932935/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/949932935/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.fee